      "id": "claim_bfd9abbe9d6f4a7b84caf7cb98fb5029",
      "statement": "check_diff.py analyzes git diffs to map changed files to affected package directories, builds a dependency graph of package relationships, and generates JSON test matrix configurations for GitHub Actions. Infrastructure changes to .github/ trigger extended tests on all core packages as a safety measure.",
